sses in number of persons employed</skos:prefLabel><skos:prefLabel xml:lang="fr">Classes de taille en nombre des personnes occupées</skos:prefLabel> </qb:DimensionProperty> </stat:dimension><stat:dimension> <qb:DimensionProperty rdf:about="https://ec.europa.eu/eurostat/api/dissemination/sdmx/2.1/codelist/ESTAT/UNIT" > <skos:prefLabel xml:lang="de">Maßeinheit</skos:prefLabel><skos:prefLabel xml:lang="en">Unit of measure</skos:prefLabel><skos:prefLabel xml:lang="fr">Unité de mesure</skos:prefLabel> </qb:DimensionProperty> </stat:dimension><stat:attribute> <qb:AttributeProperty rdf:about="https://ec.europa.eu/eurostat/api/dissemination/sdmx/2.1/codelist/ESTAT/OBS_FLAG" /> </stat:attribute><stat:attribute> <qb:AttributeProperty rdf:about="https://ec.europa.eu/eurostat/api/dissemination/sdmx/2.1/codelist/ESTAT/CONF_STATUS" /> </stat:attribute><stat:statUnitMeasure><skos:Concept rdf:about="https://ec.europa.eu/eurostat/api/dissemination/sdmx/2.1/codelist/ESTAT/INDIC_IS?code=E_CC"><skos:prefLabel xml:lang="de">Unternehmen, die kostenpflichtige Cloud Computing Dienste (CC-Dienste) über das Internet beziehen</skos:prefLabel><skos:prefLabel xml:lang="en">Buy cloud computing services used over the internet</skos:prefLabel><skos:prefLabel xml:lang="fr">Entreprises achetant des services de Cloud computing (CC)</skos:prefLabel></skos:Concept></stat:statUnitMeasure><stat:statUnitMeasure><skos:Concept rdf:about="https://ec.europa.eu/eurostat/api/dissemination/sdmx/2.1/codelist/ESTAT/INDIC_IS?code=E_CC1_B"><skos:prefLabel xml:lang="de">Unternehmen, die nur niedrige CC-Dienste kaufen, mindestens einen von: CC_PEM, CC_PSOFT, CC_PFIL, CC_PCPU</skos:prefLabel><skos:prefLabel xml:lang="en">Enterprises buying only basic CC services, at least one of: CC_PEM, CC_PSOFT, CC_PFIL, CC_PCPU</skos:prefLabel><skos:prefLabel xml:lang="fr">Entreprises n&apos;achetant que des services CC faibles, au moins un parmi : CC_PEM, CC_PSOFT, CC_PFIL, CC_PCPU</skos:prefLabel></skos:Concept></stat:statUnitMeasure><stat:statUnitMeasure><skos:Concept rdf:about="https://ec.europa.eu/eurostat/api/dissemination/sdmx/2.1/codelist/ESTAT/INDIC_IS?code=E_CC1_BI"><skos:prefLabel xml:lang="de">Unternehmen, die niedrige oder mittlere CC-Dienste  kaufen, mindestens einen von: CC_PEM, CC_PSOFT, CC_PFIL, CC_PCPU, CC_PFACC, CC_PERP, CC_PCRM</skos:prefLabel><skos:prefLabel xml:lang="en">Enterprises buying basic or intermediate CC services, at least one of:  CC_PEM, CC_PSOFT, CC_PFIL, CC_PCPU, CC_PFACC, CC_PERP, CC_PCRM</skos:prefLabel><skos:prefLabel xml:lang="fr">Entreprises achetant des services CC faibles ou intermédiaires, au moins un parmi : CC_PEM, CC_PSOFT, CC_PFIL, CC_PCPU, CC_PFACC, CC_PERP, CC_PCRM</skos:prefLabel></skos:Concept></stat:statUnitMeasure><stat:statUnitMeasure><skos:Concept rdf:about="https://ec.europa.eu/eurostat/api/dissemination/sdmx/2.1/codelist/ESTAT/INDIC_IS?code=E_CC1_I"><skos:prefLabel xml:lang="de">Unternehmen, die höchstens mittlere CC-Dienste kaufen, mindestens einen von: CC_PFACC, CC_PERP, CC_PCRM</skos:prefLabel><skos:prefLabel xml:lang="en">Enterprises buying at most  intermediate CC services, at least one of: CC_PFACC, CC_PERP, CC_PCRM</skos:prefLabel><skos:prefLabel xml:lang="fr">Entreprises achetant au plus des services CC intermédiaires, au moins un parmi : CC_PFACC, CC_PERP, CC_PCRM</skos:prefLabel></skos:Concept></stat:statUnitMeasure><stat:statUnitMeasure><skos:Concept rdf:about="https://ec.europa.eu/eurostat/api/dissemination/sdmx/2.1/codelist/ESTAT/INDIC_IS?code=E_CC1_IS_3"><skos:prefLabel xml:lang="de">Unternehmen, die alle drei der Infrastruktur-CC-Dienste kaufen: CC_PDB, CC_PFIL, CC_PCPU</skos:prefLabel><skos:prefLabel xml:lang="en">Enterprises buying all three of the CC infrastructure services: CC_PDB, CC_PFIL, CC_PCPU</skos:prefLabel><skos:prefLabel xml:lang="fr">Entreprises achetant tous les trois services CC d&apos;infrastructure : CC_PDB, CC_PFIL or CC_PCPU</skos:prefLabel></skos:Concept></stat:statUnitMeasure><stat:statUnitMeasure><skos:Concept rdf:about="https://ec.europa.eu/eurostat/api/dissemination/sdmx/2.1/codelist/ESTAT/INDIC_IS?code=E_CC1_IS_GE1"><skos:prefLabel xml:lang="de">Unternehmen, die mindestens einen der Infrastruktur-CC-Dienst kaufen: CC_PDB, CC_PFIL , CC_PCPU</skos:prefLabel><skos:prefLabel xml:lang="en">Enterprises buying at least one of the CC infrastructure service: CC_PDB, CC_PFIL, CC_PCPU</skos:prefLabel><skos:prefLabel xml:lang="fr">Entreprises achetant au moins un service CC d&apos;infrastructure :  CC_PDB, CC_PFIL or CC_PCPU</skos:prefLabel></skos:Concept></stat:statUnitMeasure><stat:statUnitMeasure><skos:Concept rdf:about="https://ec.europa.eu/eurostat/api/dissemination/sdmx/2.1/codelist/ESTAT/INDIC_IS?code=E_CC1_IS_GE2"><skos:prefLabel xml:lang="de">Unternehmen, die mindestens zwei der Infrastruktur-CC-Dienste kaufen: CC_PDB, CC_PFIL, CC_PCPU</skos:prefLabel><skos:prefLabel xml:lang="en">Enterprises buying at least two of the CC infrastructure services: CC_PDB, CC_PFIL, CC_PCPU</skos:prefLabel><skos:prefLabel xml:lang="fr">Entreprises achetant au moins deux services CC d&apos;infrastructure : I CC_PDB, CC_PFIL or CC_PCPU</skos:prefLabel></skos:Concept></stat:statUnitMeasure><stat:statUnitMeasure><skos:Concept rdf:about="https://ec.europa.eu/eurostat/api/dissemination/sdmx/2.1/codelist/ESTAT/INDIC_IS?code=E_CC1_PANY"><skos:prefLabel xml:lang="de">Unternehmen, die mindestens einen CC-Dienst kaufen: CC_PEM, CC_PSOFT, CC_PFACC, CC_PERP, CC_PCRM, CC_PSEC, CC_PDB, CC_PFIL, CC_PCPU, CC_PDEV</skos:prefLabel><skos:prefLabel xml:lang="en">Enterprises buying at least one of the CC services: CC_PEM, CC_PSOFT, CC_PFACC, CC_PERP, CC_PCRM, CC_PSEC, CC_PDB, CC_PFIL, CC_PCPU, CC_PDEV</skos:prefLabel><skos:prefLabel xml:lang="fr">Entreprises achetant au moins un des services CC : CC_PEM, CC_PSOFT, CC_PFACC, CC_PERP, CC_PCRM, CC_PSEC, CC_PDB, CC_PFIL, CC_PCPU, CC_PDEV</skos:prefLabel></skos:Concept></stat:statUnitMeasure><stat:statUnitMeasure><skos:Concept rdf:about="https://ec.europa.eu/eurostat/api/dissemination/sdmx/2.1/codelist/ESTAT/INDIC_IS?code=E_CC1_PNONE"><skos:prefLabel xml:lang="de">Unternehmen, die keine der CC-Dienste kaufen: CC_PEM, CC_PSOFT, CC_PFACC, CC_PERP, CC_PCRM, CC_PSEC, CC_PDB, CC_PFIL, CC_PCPU, CC_PDEV</skos:prefLabel><skos:prefLabel xml:lang="en">Enterprises not buying any of the CC services: CC_PEM, CC_PSOFT, CC_PFACC, CC_PERP, CC_PCRM, CC_PSEC, CC_PDB, CC_PFIL, CC_PCPU, CC_PDEV</skos:prefLabel><skos:prefLabel xml:lang="fr">Entreprises n&apos;achetant aucun des services CC : CC_PEM, CC_PSOFT, CC_PFACC, CC_PERP, CC_PCRM, CC_PSEC, CC_PDB, CC_PFIL, CC_PCPU, CC_PDEV</skos:prefLabel></skos:Concept></stat:statUnitMeasure><stat:statUnitMeasure><skos:Concept rdf:about="https://ec.europa.eu/eurostat/api/dissemination/sdmx/2.1/codelist/ESTAT/INDIC_IS?code=E_CC1_PS"><skos:prefLabel xml:lang="de">Unternehmen, die Rechenplatformen als CC-Dienst kaufen: CC_PDEV</skos:prefLabel><skos:prefLabel xml:lang="en">Enterprises buying the CC platform services: CC_PDEV</skos:prefLabel><skos:prefLabel xml:lang="fr">Entreprises achetant un service CC de plateforme : CC_PDEV</skos:prefLabel></skos:Concept></stat:statUnitMeasure><stat:statUnitMeasure><skos:Concept rdf:about="https://ec.europa.eu/eurostat/api/dissemination/sdmx/2.1/codelist/ESTAT/INDIC_IS?code=E_CC1_S"><skos:prefLabel xml:lang="de">Unternehmen, die anspruchsvolle CC-Dienste kaufen, mindestens einen von: CC_PSEC, CC_PDB, CC_PDEV</skos:prefLabel><skos:prefLabel xml:lang="en">Enterprises buying sophisticated CC services, at least one of: CC_PSEC, CC_PDB, CC_PDEV</skos:prefLabel><skos:prefLabel xml:lang="fr">Entreprises achetant des services CC sophistiqués, au moins un parmi : CC_PSEC, CC_PDB, CC_PDEV</skos:prefLabel></skos:Concept></stat:statUnitMeasure><stat:statUnitMeasure><skos:Concept rdf:about="https://ec.europa.eu/eurostat/api/dissemination/sdmx/2.1/codelist/ESTAT/INDIC_IS?code=E_CC1_SI"><skos:prefLabel xml:lang="de">Unternehmen, die anspruchsvolle oder mittlere CC-Dienste kaufen, mindestens einen von: CC_PFACC, CC_PERP, CC_PCRM, CC_PSEC, CC_PDB, CC_PDEV</skos:prefLabel><skos:prefLabel xml:lang="en">Enterprises buying sophisticated or intermediate CC services, at least one of: CC_PFACC, CC_PERP, CC_PCRM, CC_PSEC, CC_PDB, CC_PDEV</skos:prefLabel><skos:prefLabel xml:lang="fr">Entreprises achetant des services CC sophistiqués ou intermédiaires, au moins un parmi : CC_PFACC, CC_PERP, CC_PCRM, CC_PSEC, CC_PDB, CC_PDEV</skos:prefLabel></skos:Concept></stat:statUnitMeasure><stat:statUnitMeasure><skos:Concept rdf:about="https://ec.europa.eu/eurostat/api/dissemination/sdmx/2.1/codelist/ESTAT/INDIC_IS?code=E_CC1_SS1IS1PS"><skos:prefLabel xml:lang="de">Unternehmen, die einen der Software-CC-Dienste (CC_PEM, CC_PSOFT, CC_PFACC, CC_PERP, CC_PCRM, CC_PSEC), einen der Infrastruktur-CC-Dienste (CC_PDB, CC_PFIL, CC_PCPU) und Rechenplatformen als CC-Dienst (CC_PDEV) kaufen</skos:prefLabel><skos:prefLabel xml:lang="en">Enterprises buying one of the CC software service (CC_PEM, CC_PSOFT, CC_PFACC, CC_PERP, CC_PCRM, CC_PSEC), one of the CC infrastructure service (CC_PDB, CC_PFIL, CC_PCPU) and one CC platform service (CC_PDEV)</skos:prefLabel><skos:prefLabel xml:lang="fr">Entreprises achetant un des services CC d&apos;applications logicielles (CC_PEM, CC_PSOFT, CC_PFACC, CC_PERP, CC_PCRM, CC_PSEC), un des services CC d&apos;infrastructure (CC_PDB, CC_PFIL, CC_PCPU) et un service CC de plateforme (CC_PDEV)</skos:prefLabel></skos:Concept></stat:statUnitMeasure><stat:statUnitMeasure><skos:Concept rdf:about="https://ec.europa.eu/eurostat/api/dissemination/sdmx/2.1/codelist/ESTAT/INDIC_IS?code=E_CC1_SS_6"><skos:prefLabel xml:lang="de">Unternehmen, die alle sechs der Software-CC-Dienste kaufen: CC_PEM, CC_PSOFT, CC_PFACC, CC_PERP, CC_PCRM, CC_PSEC</skos:prefLabel><skos:prefLabel xml:lang="en">Enterprises buying all six of the CC software services: CC_PEM, CC_PSOFT, CC_PFACC, CC_PERP, CC_PCRM, CC_PSEC</skos:prefLabel><skos:prefLabel xml:lang="fr">Entreprises achetant tous les six services CC d&apos;applications logicielles : CC_PEM, CC_PSOFT, CC_PFACC, CC_PERP, CC_PCRM, CC_PSEC</skos:prefLabel></skos:Concept></stat:statUnitMeasure><stat:statUnitMeasure><skos:Concept rdf:about="https://ec.europa.eu/eurostat/api/dissemination/sdmx/2.1/codelist/ESTAT/INDIC_IS?code=E_CC1_SS_GE1"><skos:prefLabel xml:lang="de">Unternehmen, die mindestens einen der Software-CC-Dienste kaufen: CC_PEM, CC_PSOFT, CC_PFACC, CC_PERP, CC_PCRM, CC_PSEC</skos:prefLabel><skos:prefLabel xml:lang="en">Enterprises buying at least one of the CC software services: CC_PEM, CC_PSOFT, CC_PFACC, CC_PERP, CC_PCRM, CC_PSEC</skos:prefLabel><skos:prefLabel xml:lang="fr">Entreprises achetant au moins un service CC d&apos;applications logicielles : CC_PEM, CC_PSOFT, CC_PFACC, CC_PERP, CC_PCRM, CC_PSEC</skos:prefLabel></skos:Concept></stat:statUnitMeasure><stat:statUnitMeasure><skos:Concept rdf:about="https://ec.europa.eu/eurostat/api/dissemination/sdmx/2.1/codelist/ESTAT/INDIC_IS?code=E_CC1_SS_GE2"><skos:prefLabel xml:lang="de">Unternehmen, die mindestens zwei der Software-CC-Dienste kaufen: CC_PEM, CC_PSOFT, CC_PFACC, CC_PERP, CC_PCRM, CC_PSEC</skos:prefLabel><skos:prefLabel xml:lang="en">Enterprises buying at least two of the CC software services: CC_PEM, CC_PSOFT, CC_PFACC, CC_PERP, CC_PCRM, CC_PSEC</skos:prefLabel><skos:prefLabel xml:lang="fr">Entreprises achetant au moins deux services CC d&apos;applications logicielles : CC_PEM, CC_PSOFT, CC_PFACC, CC_PERP, CC_PCRM, CC_PSEC</skos:prefLabel></skos:Concept></stat:statUnitMeasure><stat:statUnitMeasure><skos:Concept rdf:about="https://ec.europa.eu/eurostat/api/dissemination/sdmx/2.1/codelist/ESTAT/INDIC_IS?code=E_CC1_SS_GE3"><skos:prefLabel xml:lang="de">Unternehmen, die mindestens drei der Software-CC-Dienste kaufen: CC_PEM, CC_PSOFT, CC_PFACC, CC_PERP, CC_PCRM, CC_PSEC</skos:prefLabel><skos:prefLabel xml:lang="en">Enterprises buying at least three of the CC software services: CC_PEM, CC_PSOFT, CC_PFACC, CC_PERP, CC_PCRM, CC_PSEC</skos:prefLabel><skos:prefLabel xml:lang="fr">Entreprises achetant au moins trois services CC d&apos;applications logicielles  : CC_PEM, CC_PSOFT, CC_PFACC, CC_PERP, CC_PCRM, CC_PSEC</skos:prefLabel></skos:Concept></stat:statUnitMeasure><stat:statUnitMeasure><skos:Concept rdf:about="https://ec.europa.eu/eurostat/api/dissemination/sdmx/2.1/codelist/ESTAT/INDIC_IS?code=E_CCX"><skos:prefLabel xml:lang="de">Unternehmen, die keine kostenpflichtigen CC-Dienste über das Internet beziehen</skos:prefLabel><skos:prefLabel xml:lang="en">Don&apos;t buy CC services used over the internet</skos:prefLabel><skos:prefLabel xml:lang="fr">Entreprises n&apos;achetant pas de services CC</skos:prefLabel></skos:Concept></stat:statUnitMeasure><stat:statUnitMeasure><skos:Concept rdf:about="https://ec.europa.eu/eurostat/api/dissemination/sdmx/2.1/codelist/ESTAT/INDIC_IS?code=E_CC_BS"><skos:prefLabel xml:lang="de">Unternehmen, die CC-Dienste sowohl von gemeinsam genutzten als auch von ausschließlich dem Unternehmen zur Verfügung stehenden Servern kaufen</skos:prefLabel><skos:prefLabel xml:lang="en">Buy CC services delivered from shared servers and from servers of service providers exclusively reserved for the enterprise</skos:prefLabel><skos:prefLabel xml:lang="fr">Entreprises achetant des services CC délivrés par des serveurs partagés et exclusivement dédiés à l&apos;entreprise</skos:prefLabel></skos:Concept></stat:statUnitMeasure><stat:statUnitMeasure><skos:Concept rdf:about="https://ec.europa.eu/eurostat/api/dissemination/sdmx/2.1/codelist/ESTAT/INDIC_IS?code=E_CC_DA"><skos:prefLabel xml:lang="de">Unternehmen, die kostenpflichtige Cloud Computing Dienste (CC-Dienste) über das Internet beziehen und Datenanalysen durchführen</skos:prefLabel><skos:prefLabel xml:lang="en">Enterprises buy cloud computing services used over the internet and perform data analytics</skos:prefLabel><skos:prefLabel xml:lang="fr">Les entreprises achètent des services de cloud computing utilisés sur Internet et effectuent des analyses de données</skos:prefLabel></skos:Concept></stat:statUnitMeasure><stat:statUnitMeasure><skos:Concept rdf:about="https://ec.europa.eu/eurostat/api/dissemination/sdmx/2.1/codelist/ESTAT/INDIC_IS?code=E_CC_DS"><skos:prefLabel xml:lang="de">Unternehmen, die CC-Dienste von ausschließlich dem Unternehmen zur Verfügung stehenden Servern kaufen</skos:prefLabel><skos:prefLabel xml:lang="en">Buy CC services delivered from servers of service providers exclusively reserved for the enterprise</skos:prefLabel><skos:prefLabel xml:lang="fr">Entreprises achetant des services CC délivrés par des serveurs exclusivement dédiés à l&apos;entreprise</skos:prefLabel></skos:Concept></stat:statUnitMeasure><stat:statUnitMeasure><skos:Concept rdf:about="https://ec.europa.eu/eurostat/api/dissemination/sdmx/2.1/codelist/ESTAT/INDIC_IS?code=E_CC_GE_ME"><skos:prefLabel xml:lang="de">Unternehmen, die mindestens einen der folgenden CC-Dienste kaufen - bis 2020: Betrieb von Unternehmensdatenbanken, Finanz- und Buchhaltungssoftware, CRM-Software, Rechnerkapazität</skos:prefLabel><skos:prefLabel xml:lang="en">Enterprises purchasing at least one of the following cloud computing services- until 2020: hosting of the enterprise&apos;s database, accounting software applications, CRM software, computing power</skos:prefLabel><skos:prefLabel xml:lang="fr">Entreprises achetant au moins un des services CC suivants - jusqu&apos;en 2020: hébergement de base de données, logiciels de comptabilité ou de CRM, puissance de calcul</skos:prefLabel></skos:Concept></stat:statUnitMeasure><stat:statUnitMeasure><skos:Concept rdf:about="https://ec.europa.eu/eurostat/api/dissemination/sdmx/2.1/codelist/ESTAT/INDIC_IS?code=E_CC_HI"><skos:prefLabel xml:lang="de">Unternehmen, die höhere CC-Dienste kaufen - bis 2020 (Finanz-/Buchhaltungssoftware, CRM-Software, Rechnerkapazitäten)</skos:prefLabel><skos:prefLabel xml:lang="en">Buy high CC services - until 2020 (accounting software applications, CRM software, computing power)</skos:prefLabel><skos:prefLabel xml:lang="fr">Entreprises achetant des services CC élevés - jusqu&apos;en 2020 (logiciels de comptabilité, logiciels GRC/CRM, puissance de calcul)</skos:prefLabel></skos:Concept></stat:statUnitMeasure><stat:statUnitMeasure><skos:Concept rdf:about="https://ec.europa.eu/eurostat/api/dissemination/sdmx/2.1/codelist/ESTAT/INDIC_IS?code=E_CC_IOT"><skos:prefLabel xml:lang="de">Unternehmen beziehen kostenpflichtige CC-Dienste und verwenden IoT (bis 2020)</skos:prefLabel><skos:prefLabel xml:lang="en">Enterprises buying CC services and using IoT (until 2020)</skos:prefLabel><skos:prefLabel xml:lang="fr">Entreprises achetant des services CC et utilisant l&apos;IdO (jusqu&apos;en 2020)</skos:prefLabel></skos:Concept></stat:statUnitMeasure><stat:statUnitMeasure><skos:Concept rdf:about="https://ec.europa.eu/eurostat/api/dissemination/sdmx/2.1/codelist/ESTAT/INDIC_IS?code=E_CC_IOTX"><skos:prefLabel xml:lang="de">Unternehmen beziehen kostenpflichtige CC-Dienste aber verwenden kein IoT (bis 2020)</skos:prefLabel><skos:prefLabel xml:lang="en">Enterprises buying CC services but not using IoT (until 2020)</skos:prefLabel><skos:prefLabel xml:lang="fr">Entreprises achetant des services CC mais n&apos;utilisant pas l&apos;IdO (jusqu&apos;en 2020)</skos:prefLabel></skos:Concept></stat:statUnitMeasure><stat:statUnitMeasure><skos:Concept rdf:about="https://ec.europa.eu/eurostat/api/dissemination/sdmx/2.1/codelist/ESTAT/INDIC_IS?code=E_CC_LO"><skos:prefLabel xml:lang="de">Unternehmen, die nur niedrige CC-Dienste - bis 2020 (E-Mail, Bürosoftware, Speicherung von Daten) kaufen</skos:prefLabel><skos:prefLabel xml:lang="en">Buy only low CC services - until 2020 (e-mail, office software, storage of files)</skos:prefLabel><skos:prefLabel xml:lang="fr">Entreprises achetant seulement des services CC faibles  - jusqu&apos;en 2020 (courriel, logiciels bureautiques, stockage de fichiers)</skos:prefLabel></skos:Concept></stat:statUnitMeasure><stat:statUnitMeasure><skos:Concept rdf:about="https://ec.europa.eu/eurostat/api/dissemination/sdmx/2.1/codelist/ESTAT/INDIC_IS?code=E_CC_ME"><skos:prefLabel xml:lang="de">Unternehmen, die nur mittlere CC-Dienste - bis 2020 (E-Mail, Bürosoftware, Speicherung von Daten, Betrieb von Datenbanken) kaufen</skos:prefLabel><skos:prefLabel xml:lang="en">Buy only medium CC services - until 2020 (e-mail, office software, storage of files, hosting of the enterprise&apos;s database)</skos:prefLabel><skos:prefLabel xml:lang="fr">Entreprises achetant seulement des services CC moyens  - jusqu&apos;en 2020 (courriel, logiciels bureautiques, stockage de fichiers, hébergement de bases de données)</skos:prefLabel></skos:Concept></stat:statUnitMeasure><stat:statUnitMeasure><skos:Concept rdf:about="https://ec.europa.eu/eurostat/api/dissemination/sdmx/2.1/codelist/ESTAT/INDIC_IS?code=E_CC_PANY"><skos:prefLabel xml:lang="de">Unternehmen, die mindestens einen der genannten CC-Dienste kaufen- bis 2020 (E_CC_PEM, E_CC_PSOFT, E_CC_PDB, E_CC_PFIL, E_CC_PFACC, E_CC_PCRM, E_CC_PCPU)</skos:prefLabel><skos:prefLabel xml:lang="en">Buy at least one of the mentioned CC services - until 2020 (E_CC_PEM, E_CC_PSOFT, E_CC_PDB, E_CC_PFIL, E_CC_PFACC, E_CC_PCRM, E_CC_PCPU)</skos:prefLabel><skos:prefLabel xml:lang="fr">Entreprises achetant au moins un des services CC mentionnés - jusqu&apos;en 2020 (E_CC_PEM, E_CC_PSOFT, E_CC_PDB, E_CC_PFIL, E_CC_PFACC, E_CC_PCRM, E_CC_PCPU)</skos:prefLabel></skos:Concept></stat:statUnitMeasure><stat:statUnitMeasure><skos:Concept rdf:about="https://ec.europa.eu/eurostat/api/dissemination/sdmx/2.1/codelist/ESTAT/INDIC_IS?code=E_CC_PCPU"><skos:prefLabel xml:lang="de">Unternehmen, die Rechnerkapazität für den Betrieb unternehmenseigener Software als CC-Dienst kaufen</skos:prefLabel><skos:prefLabel xml:lang="en">Buy computing power to run the enterprise&apos;s own software (as a CC service)</skos:prefLabel><skos:prefLabel xml:lang="fr">Entreprises achetant de la puissance de calcul pour faire fonctionner leurs propres logiciels (utilisée comme service CC)</skos:prefLabel></skos:Concept></stat:statUnitMeasure><stat:statUnitMeasure><skos:Concept rdf:about="https://ec.europa.eu/eurostat/api/dissemination/sdmx/2.1/codelist/ESTAT/INDIC_IS?code=E_CC_PCRM"><skos:prefLabel xml:lang="de">Unternehmen, die CRM-Software als CC-Dienst kaufen</skos:prefLabel><skos:prefLabel xml:lang="en">Buy Customer Relationship Management (CRM) software (as a CC service)</skos:prefLabel><skos:prefLabel xml:lang="fr">Entreprises achetant des logiciels de GRC/CRM (utilisés comme service CC)</skos:prefLabel></skos:Concept></stat:statUnitMeasure><stat:statUnitMeasure><skos:Concept rdf:about="https://ec.europa.eu/eurostat/api/dissemination/sdmx/2.1/codelist/ESTAT/INDIC_IS?code=E_CC_PDB"><skos:prefLabel xml:lang="de">Unternehmen, die den Betrieb von Unternehmensdatenbanken als CC-Dienst kaufen</skos:prefLabel><skos:prefLabel xml:lang="en">Buy hosting for the enterprise&apos;s database (as a CC service)</skos:prefLabel><skos:prefLabel xml:lang="fr">Entreprises achetant de l&apos;hébergement de bases de données de l&apos;entreprise (utilisé comme service CC)</skos:prefLabel></skos:Concept></stat:statUnitMeasure><stat:statUnitMeasure><skos:Concept rdf:about="https://ec.europa.eu/eurostat/api/dissemination/sdmx/2.1/codelist/ESTAT/INDIC_IS?code=E_CC_PDBFIL"><skos:prefLabel xml:lang="de">Unternehmen, die den Betrieb von Unternehmensdatenbanken oder die Speicherung von Daten als CC-Dienst kaufen</skos:prefLabel><skos:prefLabel xml:lang="en">Enterprises buying hosting for the enterprise&apos;s database(s) or storage of files</skos:prefLabel><skos:prefLabel xml:lang="fr">Entreprises achetant un hébergement pour leur(s) base(s) de données ou le stockage de fichiers</skos:prefLabel></skos:Concept></stat:statUnitMeasure><stat:statUnitMeasure><skos:Concept rdf:about="https://ec.europa.eu/eurostat/api/dissemination/sdmx/2.1/codelist/ESTAT/INDIC_IS?code=E_CC_PDEV"><skos:prefLabel xml:lang="de">Unternehmen, die Rechenplatformen als CC-Dienst kaufen, die eine gehostete Umgebung für Anwendungsentwicklung, Erprobung oder Einführung anbieten</skos:prefLabel><skos:prefLabel xml:lang="en">Buy computing platform providing a hosted environment for application development, testing or deployment (as a CC service)</skos:prefLabel><skos:prefLabel xml:lang="fr">Entreprises achetant une plateforme numérique fournissant un environnement hébergé pour le développement, le test et le déploiement d’applications (utilisée comme service CC)</skos:prefLabel></skos:Concept></stat:statUnitMeasure><stat:statUnitMeasure><skos:Concept rdf:about="https://ec.europa.eu/eurostat/api/dissemination/sdmx/2.1/codelist/ESTAT/INDIC_IS?code=E_CC_PEM"><skos:prefLabel xml:lang="de">Unternehmen, die E-Mail als CC-Dienst kaufen</skos:prefLabel><skos:prefLabel xml:lang="en">Buy e-mail (as a CC service)</skos:prefLabel><skos:prefLabel xml:lang="fr">Entreprises achetant le service courriel (utilisé comme service CC)</skos:prefLabel></skos:Concept></stat:statUnitMeasure><stat:statUnitMeasure><skos:Concept rdf:about="https://ec.europa.eu/eurostat/api/dissemination/sdmx/2.1/codelist/ESTAT/INDIC_IS?code=E_CC_PERP"><skos:prefLabel xml:lang="de">Unternehmen, die ERP-Software als CC-Dienst kaufen</skos:prefLabel><skos:prefLabel xml:lang="en">Buy ERP software applications (as a CC service)</skos:prefLabel><skos:prefLabel xml:lang="fr">Entreprises achetant des applications logicielles d’ERP (utilisées comme service CC)</skos:prefLabel></skos:Concept></stat:statUnitMeasure><stat:statUnitMeasure><skos:Concept rdf:about="https://ec.europa.eu/eurostat/api/dissemination/sdmx/2.1/codelist/ESTAT/INDIC_IS?code=E_CC_PFACC"><skos:prefLabel xml:lang="de">Unternehmen, die Finanz- und Buchhaltungssoftware als CC-Dienst kaufen</skos:prefLabel><skos:prefLabel xml:lang="en">Buy finance or accounting software applications (as a CC service)</skos:prefLabel><skos:prefLabel xml:lang="fr">Entreprises achetant des logiciels de comptabilité (utilisés comme service CC)</skos:prefLabel></skos:Concept></stat:statUnitMeasure><stat:statUnitMeasure><skos:Concept rdf:about="https://ec.europa.eu/eurostat/api/dissemination/sdmx/2.1/codelist/ESTAT/INDIC_IS?code=E_CC_PFIL"><skos:prefLabel xml:lang="de">Unternehmen, die die Speicherung von Daten als CC-Dienst kaufen</skos:prefLabel><skos:prefLabel xml:lang="en">Buy storage of files (as a CC service)</skos:prefLabel><skos:prefLabel xml:lang="fr">Entreprises achetant du stockage de fichiers (utilisé comme service CC)</skos:prefLabel></skos:Concept></stat:statUnitMeasure><stat:statUnitMeasure><skos:Concept rdf:about="https://ec.europa.eu/eurostat/api/dissemination/sdmx/2.1/codelist/ESTAT/INDIC_IS?code=E_CC_PHW"><skos:prefLabel xml:lang="de">Unternehmen, die den Betrieb von Unternehmensdatenbanken oder die Speicherung von Daten als CC-Dienst kaufen</skos:prefLabel><skos:prefLabel xml:lang="en">Enterprises buying hosting for the enterprise&apos;s database(s) or storage of files or computing power</skos:prefLabel><skos:prefLabel xml:lang="fr">Entreprises achetant un hébergement pour leur(s) base(s) de données ou le stockage de fichiers ou de la puissance de calcul</skos:prefLabel></skos:Concept></stat:statUnitMeasure><stat:statUnitMeasure><skos:Concept rdf:about="https://ec.europa.eu/eurostat/api/dissemination/sdmx/2.1/codelist/ESTAT/INDIC_IS?code=E_CC_PNONE"><skos:prefLabel xml:lang="de">Unternehmen, die keine der genannten CC-Dienste kaufen - bis 2020 (E_CC_PEM, E_CC_PSOFT, E_CC_PDB, E_CC_PFIL, E_CC_PFACC, E_CC_PCRM, E_CC_PCPU)</skos:prefLabel><skos:prefLabel xml:lang="en">Don&apos;t buy any of the mentioned CC services - until 2020 (E_CC_PEM, E_CC_PSOFT, E_CC_PDB, E_CC_PFIL, E_CC_PFACC, E_CC_PCRM, E_CC_PCPU)</skos:prefLabel><skos:prefLabel xml:lang="fr">Entreprises n&apos;achetant aucun des services CC mentionnés - jusqu&apos;en 2020 (E_CC_PEM, E_CC_PSOFT, E_CC_PDB, E_CC_PFIL, E_CC_PFACC, E_CC_PCRM, E_CC_PCPU)</skos:prefLabel></skos:Concept></stat:statUnitMeasure><stat:statUnitMeasure><skos:Concept rdf:about="https://ec.europa.eu/eurostat/api/dissemination/sdmx/2.1/codelist/ESTAT/INDIC_IS?code=E_CC_PSEC"><skos:prefLabel xml:lang="de">Unternehmen, die Sicherheits-Software als CC-Dienst kaufen</skos:prefLabel><skos:prefLabel xml:lang="en">Buy security software applications (as a CC service)</skos:prefLabel><skos:prefLabel xml:lang="fr">Entreprises achetant des applications logicielles de sécurité (utilisées comme service CC)</skos:prefLabel></skos:Concept></stat:statUnitMeasure><stat:statUnitMeasure><skos:Concept rdf:about="https://ec.europa.eu/eurostat/api/dissemination/sdmx/2.1/codelist/ESTAT/INDIC_IS?code=E_CC_PSOFT"><skos:prefLabel xml:lang="de">Unternehmen, die Bürosoftware als CC-Dienst kaufen (z.B. Textverarbeitung, Tabellenkalkulation, usw.)</skos:prefLabel><skos:prefLabel xml:lang="en">Buy office software (e.g. word processors, spreadsheets, etc.) (as a CC service)</skos:prefLabel><skos:prefLabel xml:lang="fr">Entreprises achetant des logiciels de bureautique (utilisé comme service CC)</skos:prefLabel></skos:Concept></stat:statUnitMeasure><stat:statUnitMeasure><skos:Concept rdf:about="https://ec.europa.eu/eurostat/api/dissemination/sdmx/2.1/codelist/ESTAT/INDIC_IS?code=E_CC_SS"><skos:prefLabel xml:lang="de">Unternehmen, die CC-Dienste von gemeinsam genutzten Servern mehrerer Anwender kaufen</skos:prefLabel><skos:prefLabel xml:lang="en">Buy CC services delivered from shared servers of service providers</skos:prefLabel><skos:prefLabel xml:lang="fr">Entreprises achetant des services CC délivrés par des serveurs partagés</skos:prefLabel></skos:Concept></stat:statUnitMeasure><stat:statUnitMeasure><skos:Concept rdf:about="https://ec.europa.eu/eurostat/api/dissemination/sdmx/2.1/codelist/ESTAT/UNIT?code=PC_ENT"><skos:prefLabel xml:lang="de">Prozent der Unternehmen</skos:prefLabel><skos:prefLabel xml:lang="en">Percentage of enterprises</skos:prefLabel><skos:prefLabel xml:lang="fr">Pourcentage des entreprises</skos:prefLabel></skos:Concept></stat:statUnitMeasure><stat:statUnitMeasure><skos:Concept rdf:about="https://ec.europa.eu/eurostat/api/dissemination/sdmx/2.1/codelist/ESTAT/UNIT?code=PC_ENT_CC"><skos:prefLabel xml:lang="de">Prozent der Unternehmen, die kostenpflichtige CC-Dienste beziehen</skos:prefLabel><skos:prefLabel xml:lang="en">Percentage of enterprises buying CC services</skos:prefLabel><skos:prefLabel xml:lang="fr">Pourcentage d&apos;entreprises achetant des services CC</skos:prefLabel></skos:Concept></stat:statUnitMeasure><stat:statUnitMeasure><skos:Concept rdf:about="https://ec.europa.eu/eurostat/api/dissemination/sdmx/2.1/codelist/ESTAT/UNIT?code=PC_ENT_CUSE"><skos:prefLabel xml:lang="de">Prozent der Unternehmen die Computer verwenden</skos:prefLabel><skos:prefLabel xml:lang="en">Percentage of the enterprises which use a computer</skos:prefLabel><skos:prefLabel xml:lang="fr">Pourcentage des entreprises utilisant l&apos;ordinateur</skos:prefLabel></skos:Concept></stat:statUnitMeasure><stat:statUnitMeasure><skos:Concept rdf:about="https://ec.europa.eu/eurostat/api/dissemination/sdmx/2.1/codelist/ESTAT/UNIT?code=PC_ENT_IACC"><skos:prefLabel xml:lang="de">Prozent der Unternehmen die Zugang zum Internet haben</skos:prefLabel><skos:prefLabel xml:lang="en">Percentage of the enterprises with internet access</skos:prefLabel><skos:prefLabel xml:lang="fr">Pourcentage des entreprises ayant accès à l&apos;internet</skos:prefLabel></skos:Concept></stat:statUnitMeasure><stat:statUnitMeasure><skos:Concept rdf:about="https://ec.europa.eu/eurostat/api/dissemination/sdmx/2.1/codelist/ESTAT/UNIT?code=PC_ENT_IUSE"><skos:prefLabel xml:lang="de">Prozent der Unternehmen, in denen Beschäftigte Zugang zum Internet haben</skos:prefLabel><skos:prefLabel xml:lang="en">Percentage of enterprises where persons employed have access to the internet</skos:prefLabel><skos:prefLabel xml:lang="fr">Pourcentage des entreprises avec personnes occupées ayant accès à l&apos;internet</skos:prefLabel></skos:Concep